OL,3,GNEWSADoomed glass centre looked for
OL,4,Arevenue consultant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university tried and failed to hire a
OL,7,Fconsultant to boost the National Glass
OL,8,FCentre's (NGC) revenue before deciding
OL,9,Fto shut the facility.
OL,11,FIn 2021, more than 12 months before the
OL,12,FUniversity of Sunderland announced its
OL,13,Fdecision to close the NGC, it looked to
OL,14,Frecruit someone to produce an
OL,15,F"ambitious four-year plan" to increase
OL,16,Fthe attraction's income. The university
OL,17,Fhas since acknowledged no consultant
OL,18,Fwas hired.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
