OL,3,GNEWSADoomed glass centre looked for
OL,4,Arevenue consultant
OL,5,
OL,6,FSave the Glass Centre activist Carolyn
OL,7,FBasing claimed this offered proof the
OL,8,Funiversity had not tried hard enough to
OL,9,Fincrease the venue's revenue.
OL,11,FA spokesperson for the university,
OL,12,Fwhich finally closed the NGC in July,
OL,13,Fdeclined to comment on why no
OL,14,Fconsultant was hired.
